## Conclusion

<filled by researcher; ONE of:>

- **VALIDATED** — measured within `[acceptance]` band; no fix required.
- **NEEDS-FIX** — measurement outside band; implementer to land fix +
  regression test.
- **CEILING-LIMIT** — solver class cannot reach the band without changes
  forbidden by spec §2.
- **LITERATURE-AMBIGUOUS** — sources cited disagree; finding closes with
  documented ambiguity.
- **SOLVER-CHANGE-REQUIRED** — fix requires a change to
  `crates/engine-sim/src/solver/`; surfaced to user for explicit decision.
- **ABANDONED** — investigation ceased without resolution; documented reason.

